# Generated, not authored. `linguist-generated` collapses these in GitHub diffs and keeps them out
# of the language statistics; `-diff` stops git from producing a textual diff for them at all.
#
# This is load-bearing rather than cosmetic. The Lucide wrapper is 1767 files — one module per icon,
# which is what makes a single-icon import cost 104 bytes instead of the whole set — and their first
# commit pushed the PR to 1876 changed files, past the point where the automated reviewer gives up
# and skips the review entirely. A human reviewing the generator is the point; a human scrolling
# 1767 near-identical files is not.
#
# Regenerate with `bun run packages/ui/src/icons/build-icons.ts`; review that file, not its output.
packages/ui/src/icons/glyphs/*.ts linguist-generated=true -diff

# The committed manifest is written by `bun run manifest` and drift is a gate failure, never a
# hand edit — reviewing it line by line is reviewing the generator's output twice.
framework.manifest.json linguist-generated=true

# Bun's lockfile. Regenerated by `bun install`, never edited by hand.
bun.lock -diff linguist-generated=true
